SUMMARY:Deadline: Auslandsstipendien von Bund und Laendern 2028 (Villa Mass
 imo\, Casa Baldi\, Venice\, Paris)
DESCRIPTION:Germany's flagship residency awards for visual artists\, archit
 ects\, writers and composers\, administered by the Kulturstiftung der Laen
 der for the federal government. One application window covers the Rome Pri
 ze at Villa Massimo (10 months\, EUR 3\,000/month\, international visibili
 ty expected)\, Casa Baldi in Olevano Romano (3 months\, EUR 3\,000/month)\
 , the Deutsches Studienzentrum in Venice (3 months\, EUR 1\,534/month) and
  a 6-month Paris residency (approx. EUR 1\,500/month). Accommodation and s
 tudio are provided everywhere. ELIGIBILITY: German citizenship\, or primar
 y residence and artistic practice in Germany. Application window 1 October
  to 15 December 2026 for residencies in 2028\, via auslandsstipendien-von-
 bund-und-laendern.de. DEADLINE: 15 December 2026\, 23:59.\n\nOrganisation:
  Kulturstiftung der Laender / BKM (German federal and state governments)\n
 Location: Residencies in Rome (Villa Massimo\, 10 months)\, Olevano Romano
  (Casa Baldi\, 3 months)\, Venice (Deutsches Studienzentrum\, 3 months) an
 d Paris (6 months). RESTRICTED: German citizenship OR primary residence an
 d artistic practice in Germany.\nAward: Villa Massimo: EUR 3\,000/month\; 
 Casa Baldi: EUR 3\,000/month\; Deutsches Studienzentrum Venedig: EUR 1\,53
 4/month\; Paris: approx. EUR 1\,500/month. Accommodation and studio provid
 ed at all locations. No application fee.\nDuration: 3 to 10 months dependi
 ng on residency\n\nMore: https://www.kulturstiftung.de/auslandsstipendien-
 von-bund-und-laendern-allgemeines/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&u
 tm_medium=referral
URL:https://www.kulturstiftung.de/auslandsstipendien-von-bund-und-laendern-
 allgemeines/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Residencies in Rome (Villa Massimo\, 10 months)\, Olevano Romano (
 Casa Baldi\, 3 months)\, Venice (Deutsches Studienzentrum\, 3 months) and 
 Paris (6 months). RESTRICTED: German citizenship OR primary residence and 
 artistic practice in Germany.
END:VEVENT
