SUMMARY:Deadline: workspacebrussels Studio Residencies\, August to December
  2027
DESCRIPTION:Research and creation studio residencies in Brussels for artist
 s working in the performing arts in the broad sense: dance\, performance\,
  theatre and crossovers with other disciplines (projects that are purely c
 ircus\, visual art\, music or for young audiences are excluded). WHAT YOU 
 GET: one to two weeks of free studio space tailored to your project\, a EU
 R 750 flat fee per selected project for travel and lunch\, overnight guest
 house accommodation for international artists subject to availability\, ba
 sic technical equipment in some studios\, and an optional moment to share 
 work with other residents. ELIGIBILITY: open to Belgian and international 
 artists and collectives at any career stage. Applications can be written o
 r submitted as audio or video\, in Dutch\, French or English. DEADLINE: 1 
 December 2026 for residencies between August and December 2027\; selection
 s announced end of February 2027.\n\nOrganisation: workspacebrussels\nLoca
 tion: Brussels\, Belgium. Open to Belgian and international performing art
 ists\; guesthouse accommodation available for internationals (limited avai
 lability).\nAward: EUR 750 flat fee per selected project for travel and lu
 nch costs\, plus a free studio for one to two weeks\, basic technical equi
 pment in some studios\, communal lunches and optional work sharings. No ap
 plication fee.\nDuration: 1 to 2 weeks between August and December 2027\n\
 nMore: https://www.workspacebrussels.be/en/studio-residency?utm_source=art
 ificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
